From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vipul Cariappa <vipulcariappa@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 09:59:16 +0530
Subject: Preload the CppInterOp headers the interpreter is told to use

cppjit hands the interpreter an include directory at startup and then processes
a block of headers ending in `#include <CppInterOp/Dispatch.h>`. In the wasm
kernel that directory is `/include` in the browser's filesystem, which had the
sysroot, clang's headers and cpyrt's -- but not CppInterOp's. So the include
failed, and with it the whole input.

The consequence was far worse than a missing header. clang-repl's cleanup after
a failed input leaves lookup damaged on the LLVM this builds against: the failing
input itself is survivable, but the *next* declaration processed drops
header-declared names out of name lookup. Everything a cell had declared stayed
findable while `std` did not, so `import cppjit` died on `CreateScopeProxy("std")`
claiming std was not a known C++ class -- in an interpreter that had just
compiled `std::string` without complaint.

Preloading the headers is the whole fix; the include resolves, the input
succeeds, and nothing gets cleaned up. Worth knowing that the symptom pointed
nowhere near the cause: the failing include is silent from Python's side, and
what surfaces is a name lookup failing several steps later for a name that has
nothing to do with the header that was missing.

(cherry picked from commit ea106db6d8b0556a30327b20dc4a065fc77279ed)
---
 CMakeLists.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 5dfabb9..81446e1 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -512,6 +512,7 @@ if(EMSCRIPTEN)
         PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${ESCAPED_SYSROOT_PATH}/include@/include"
         PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${ESCAPED_XEUS_CPP_RESOURCE_DIR}@/${CMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR}/clang/${CPPINTEROP_LLVM_VERSION_MAJOR}"
         PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${CPPJIT_SOURCE_DIR}/src/cpyrt@/include/cpyrt"
+        PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${CPPINTEROP_INSTALL_PREFIX}/include/CppInterOp@/include/CppInterOp"
         PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${CPPJIT_BUILD_DIR}/libcppjit.so@/lib/python${XEUS_CPP_WASM_PYTHON_VERSION}/site-packages/libcppjit.so"
         PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${CPPJIT_SOURCE_DIR}/python/cppjit@/lib/python${XEUS_CPP_WASM_PYTHON_VERSION}/site-packages/cppjit"
         PUBLIC "SHELL: --preload-file ${CPPJIT_SOURCE_DIR}/python/cppjit_backend@/lib/python${XEUS_CPP_WASM_PYTHON_VERSION}/site-packages/cppjit_backend"
